    "answer": {
      "short": "Frequencies, from top to bottom: $5,6,5,4,2$. Median $=70$.",
      "worked": "Counting the leaves gives frequencies $5,6,5,4,2$.\n\n$$n=5+6+5+4+2=22$$\n\nThe median is the average of the 11th and 12th values. The first two rows contain $5+6=11$ values, so the 11th value is $69$ and the 12th value is $71$.\n\n$$\\text{Median}=\\frac{69+71}{2}=70$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
